\title{openalexAPI: Local OpenAlex-Compatible Web API over a Parquet Corpus}
\description{
Serves a local Parquet corpus of OpenAlex works through a web API that answers like the OpenAlex '/works' endpoint, so the same classic filter URLs, OQL (OpenAlex Query Language) and OQO (OpenAlex Query Object) queries, including 'group_by', can be run against local data. Queries are translated to OQO by the free OpenAlex '/query' endpoint and compiled locally to DuckDB SQL. A small static web page is included for running searches in the browser.
}
